1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:02,167
(Beverley:)-Did I thank you for the flowers?
-You did.

2
00:00:02,455 --> 00:00:04,585
(Beverley:)-I don't really like flowers.
-Neither do I.

3
00:00:04,749 --> 00:00:07,999
(Sheldon:)-But it's the social convention.
-It is, isn't it?

4
00:00:08,169 --> 00:00:09,999
(Leonard:)Wait, wait, wait. You had surgery?

5
00:00:10,171 --> 00:00:12,841
(Beverley:)-Yes, and Sheldon sent me flowers.
-No, I heard that.

6
00:00:13,007 --> 00:00:15,847
(Beverley:)Then what was all that
"wait, wait, wait" about?

7
00:00:16,344 --> 00:00:20,344
(Leonard:)I just don't understand why
he knows more about your life than I do.

8
00:00:20,514 --> 00:00:24,264
(Beverley:)Because Sheldon and I stay in touch
due to mutual interest and respect...

9
00:00:24,435 --> 00:00:28,105
(Beverley:)...while you avoid me
due to unresolved childhood issues.

10
00:00:28,606 --> 00:00:32,196
(Sheldon:)It's what we think caused
your narcissistic-personality disorder.

11
00:00:33,361 --> 00:00:36,201
(Sheldon:)We discussed it at length
during our last video chat.

12
00:00:36,364 --> 00:00:39,244
(Sheldon:)Although how we got
onto the subject of you is baffling.

13
00:00:39,408 --> 00:00:43,248
(Beverley:)Yes, but we are on the subject,
so I'm obliged to ask.

14
00:00:43,412 --> 00:00:45,792
(Beverley:)Leonard, how are you?

15
00:00:46,791 --> 00:00:49,581
(Leonard:)-Fine, Mom. How are you?
-Menopausal.

16
00:00:50,586 --> 00:00:52,796
(Leonard:)Now I'm less fine.

17
00:00:53,381 --> 00:00:56,631
-Have you heard your brother's engaged?
-No.

